description:
Implement `useHeadlessCombobox` — a headless combobox hook with full ARIA compliance. The hook manages filtering, open state, and selection, while returning all props needed for accessible markup.

**Example:**
```tsx
function Combobox() {
  const { inputProps, listboxProps, getOptionProps, filtered, isOpen, selectedValue } =
    useHeadlessCombobox(['Apple', 'Banana', 'Cherry']);

  return (
    <div>
      <input {...inputProps} placeholder="Search..." />
      {isOpen && (
        <ul {...listboxProps}>
          {filtered.map(opt => (
            <li key={opt} {...getOptionProps(opt)}>{opt}</li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      )}
    </div>
  );
}
```

